stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Deciding: mount

  Deciding --> Controlled: checked is defined
  Deciding --> Uncontrolled: checked is undefined

  state Controlled {
    [*] --> ParentOwns
    ParentOwns --> ParentOwns: setter is a no-op<br/>onChange still fires
  }

  state Uncontrolled {
    [*] --> ComponentOwns
    ComponentOwns --> ComponentOwns: setter updates internal state<br/>defaultChecked ignored after mount
  }

  note right of Deciding
    Decided once, never re-evaluated.
    Passing undefined at mount latches
    uncontrolled for the component's life.
  end note
